<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Charles Schelket cut his 1996 share earnings estimate on AT&amp;T Corp to $3.62 from $3.67 and maintained his neutral rating, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 57-3/4 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
